T*
(This Statement of Work is entered into as of June 1, 2026 between Vertex Systems Inc.) Tj T*
(\("Provider"\) and Meridian Freight Holdings LLC \("Customer"\) and is governed by the Master) Tj T*
(Services Agreement referenced above.) Tj T*
T*
(1. Scope of Work. Provider shall deliver a phase-two migration of Customer's depot) Tj T*
(scheduling workload onto the Vertex platform, including data migration, integration with) Tj T*
(Customer's existing telematics provider, and two rounds of user acceptance testing.) Tj T*
T*
(2. Milestones and Deliverables. Delivery proceeds in four sprints of two weeks each. Sprint) Tj T*
(one delivers the data migration plan; sprint two delivers the telematics integration; sprint) Tj T*
(three delivers the scheduling module; sprint four delivers user acceptance testing and) Tj T*
(handover documentation.) Tj T*
T*
(3. Rates and Invoicing. Services under this Statement of Work are charged on a) Tj T*
(time-and-materials basis at the rates set out in Appendix B. Provider shall invoice monthly) Tj T*
(in arrears for hours actually worked, supported by a timesheet summary.) Tj T*
T*
(4. Acceptance. Customer shall have ten \(10\) business days from delivery of each milestone to) Tj T*
(accept or reject it in writing, stating the grounds for any rejection. A milestone not) Tj T*
(rejected within that period is deemed accepted.) Tj T*
T*
(5. Key Personnel. Provider shall assign a named engagement lead and a named solution) Tj T*
(architect to this Statement of Work and shall not replace either without Customer's prior) Tj T*
(written consent, not to be unreasonably withheld.) Tj T*
T*
(6. Confidentiality. Each Party shall protect the other Party's Confidential Information) Tj T*
(using no less than reasonable care, shall use it solely to perform under this Agreement, and) Tj T*
(shall not disclose it to third parties except to employees and contractors bound by) Tj T*
(comparable obligations. These obligations survive for three \(3\) years after termination, and) Tj T*
(indefinitely for trade secrets.) Tj T*
T*
(7. Governing Law. This Agreement is governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, without) Tj T*
(regard to its conflict-of-laws principles. The Parties submit to the exclusive jurisdiction) Tj T*
(of the state and federal courts located in Wilmington, Delaware.) Tj T*
